	(text "G3 TODO: (1) Q24 CSI order: module pads D0N,D0P,CLKP,CLKN,D1N,D1P vs J2 D0,D1,CLK - pair crossing / P-N swap at J2 vias (05 §6, §13).\\n(2) Q5 CAM_PWDN polarity: fit R51 OR R52 (never both). (3) Q6 FPC contact side: J2 footprint TE 1-84953-5 is a placeholder; contact side (84952 vs 84953) to be checked in TE datasheet vs camera FPC [NOT VERIFIED].\\n(4) I2C pull-ups R31/R32 (P4 sheet) DNP until camera I/O level known. (5) 07 #38 control-line ESD on SCL/SDA/PWDN not drawn yet.\\nU6 = TPS22917DBV (TPS22918-class, KiCad-verified pinout); QOD tied to VOUT."
